                           fm1_1RB1LA_1LA1RC_1LB1RD_0LA0RB fm2_1RB1LA_1LA1RC_1LB1RD_0LA0RB 0 vis_1RB1LA_1LA1RC_1LB1RD_0LA0RB
                           [1] 0 6).
  - vm_compute; lia.
  - vm_compute; reflexivity.
  - vm_compute; reflexivity.
  - intros ph Hph.
    destruct ph as [|ph].
    { vm_compute; repeat constructor. }
    exfalso; lia.
  - intros ph Hph.
    destruct ph as [|ph].
    { vm_compute; repeat constructor. }
    exfalso; lia.
  - intros ph Hph.
