  check_arm tm false true rules iarm0_0_1RB1LC_0LA1RB_1LA0RB_______
            ch_iarm0_0_1RB1LC_0LA1RB_1LA0RB_______ = true.
Proof. vm_compute. reflexivity. Qed.

